    "caption": "Lucille Ball's sitcom starred a diamond. In 1970, her show Here's Lucy invited Elizabeth Taylor and Richard Burton. The episode was called Lucy Meets the Burtons. Burton hides from fans in a plumber's overalls, and Lucy finds a diamond ring in them and tries it on. It gets stuck on her finger, and Taylor cannot pull it off, so Lucy's arms stand in for Taylor's at a press event. The ring in the plot is the real Taylor Burton diamond. That pear shaped diamond weighs 69.42 carats.",
